  "rationale": "Blocking backupHost:lateralMovement, jumpHost:lateralMovement and printServer:lateralMovement makes the target unreachable. backupHost is the only route from tokenCache, kerberoast and browserStore into dbReplica and shareMount. jumpHost is the only route into mailArchive and dbReplica, and blocking it also disables localAdmin. printServer is the only route from dbLogin into dbReplica, and blocking it also disables secretsManager, which in turn cuts off codeRepo and the secretsManager route to shareMount. Two blocks cannot suffice because three paths share no intermediate steps: internet -> tokenCache -> backupHost -> shareMount; wifiGuest -> kerberoast -> jumpHost -> mailArchive; and wifiGuest/phishing -> sshKey plus ciRunner -> dbLogin -> printServer -> dbReplica."
